@base = http://localhost:8000

### Secret Morse message
GET {{base}}/api/secret-message

### Hint
GET {{base}}/api/hint

### Encode Bulgarian text
POST {{base}}/api/encode
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

А Б

### Decode Morse
POST {{base}}/api/decode
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

.- / -...
